1
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:13,096
Is he not training
with us again today?

2
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:13,847
I don't know.

3
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:15,139
It's his choice.

4
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:16,850
Hey, by the way
did you see that?

5
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:17,392
What?

6
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:19,269
The ghost!

7
00:00:19,269 --> 00:00:20,353
Nonsense!

8
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:21,979
What I saw last night...

9
00:00:24,691 --> 00:00:25,931
Did you see anything
last night?

10
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,101
Anyway, stop talking nonsense.

11
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,065
You're doing
500 fungos reps today.

12
00:00:30,457 --> 00:00:31,457
No way!

13
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:33,741
Hey!

14
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,280
He's going outside
at this hour again.
